                      (    constants.asm):00246         * Allocated against the standard specification. These are not catchable--i.e.
                      (    constants.asm):00247         * we branch directly to ERRHDLR (under the 16 bit interface). They're not
                      (    constants.asm):00248         * recoverable anyway.
