                      (        forth.asm):04238         * particular purpose here: a 16x16 bit unsigned multiplication that yields
                      (        forth.asm):04239         * a 32 bit result. A simpler description of algorithm M can be found in
                      (        forth.asm):04240         * Henry S. Warren Junior's "Hacker's Delight", second edition, section 8-1,
                      (        forth.asm):04241         * pp 171. A C prototype implementation for a little endian host is provided
                      (        forth.asm):04242         * in SW/util/umstar.c.
                      (        forth.asm):04243         * In essence we reduce the problem to a 2 digit by 2 digit (expressed in
                      (        forth.asm):04244         * base 256) multiplication and use the 6809 MUL (A * B -> D) instruction.
